<ProjectLayout backLink="/" nextLink="/project/trade-your-pants/2" title="trade your pants" description="people were invited to give me their old pants for me to re-sew into hats or bags or something useful.">
  <Image src={trade2Img} alt="corinne sewing" width="432" />
  <Image src={pants2Img} alt="pants" />
  <p class="project-description">the 'trade your pants' project started with a show in hawaii called eco/logic, and i did it as a mail-in project. i sent postcards to hawaii and left them in the gallery for people to take and mail to me with a pair of pants which i would then sew into hats or bags or something useful. and since then i have kind of been extending the project into an ongoing thing. i also did the project intensively for a month in new york at a space on the lower east side. (more details on the next page)</p>
</ProjectLayout>
